#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography, and how quantum "
"computing poses a risk to existing cryptography."
msgstr ""
"Pengantar praktis kriptografi aman-kuantum, dan bagaimana komputasi kuantum "
"menimbulkan risiko terhadap kriptografi yang ada."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-safe-"
"cryptography/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A practical introduction to quantum-safe cryptography is a free online "
"course in  IBM Quantum&reg; Learning and serves as a primer on the "
"foundational concepts in quantum-safe cryptography.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengantar praktis kriptografi aman-kuantum adalah kursus online gratis di "
"IBM Quantum&reg; Learning dan berfungsi sebagai primer konsep-konsep dasar "
"dalam kriptografi aman-kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course was created for developers who are interested in modernizing "
"their application security and features multimodal lessons and interactive "
"live code examples in four core areas of cryptography: cryptographic hash "
"functions, symmetric key cryptography, asymmetric key cryptography, and "
"quantum-safe cryptography.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini dibuat untuk pengembang yang tertarik memodernisasi keamanan "
"aplikasi mereka dan menampilkan pelajaran multimodal serta contoh kode "
"langsung interaktif dalam empat area inti kriptografi: fungsi hash "
"kriptografi, kriptografi kunci simetris, kriptografi kunci asimetris, dan "
"kriptografi aman-kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By taking this course, developers will learn how the cybersecurity risk "
"landscape is evolving as well as explore contemporary approaches poised to "
"shape the quantum era.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan mengikuti kursus ini, pengembang akan belajar bagaimana lanskap "
"risiko keamanan siber berkembang serta mengeksplorasi pendekatan-pendekatan "
"kontemporer yang siap membentuk era kuantum.\n"

